            },
            {
                "category": "summary",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae AIStore\u2122 framework.&nbsp;<div><span style=\"color: var(--text-color-primary); font-family: var(--psirt-font-family-sans);\">To protect your system, download and install the latest version of the NVIDIA AIStore framework from the <a href=\"https://github.com/NVIDIA/aistore\">NVIDIA/aistore</a> GitHub repo.</span></div>",
                "title": "Summary"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae AIStore\u2122 framework.&nbsp;<div><span style=\"color: var(--text-color-primary); font-family: var(--psirt-font-family-sans);\">To protect your system, latest version of the NVIDIA AIStore framework from the <a href=\"https://github.com/NVIDIA/aistore\">NVIDIA/aistore</a> GitHub repo.</span></div>",
                "title": "Security Update Notes"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "These issues were found externally.",
                "title": "Bulletin Notes"
            },
